# vhs tape: status — deterministic, runs against examples/fixtures/demo.yaml (no cluster)
Output docs/demo/status.gif
Set Shell fish
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1100
Set Height 420
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Env NFCTL_FIXTURE examples/fixtures/demo.yaml
Type "nfctl status fanout"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Screenshot docs/demo/status.png
Sleep 1s
Sleep 1s
